muro 1.5
name Curtain wall symbol
unit mm

grid X 0 8000
grid Y 0 5000
level L1 0 h:2800 slab:200

asset CW4 window w:6400 h:2600 style:curtain-wall panels:4 name:Curtain-wall-four-panel

